086525007", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974654_564151093191673_8784663539304125960_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J39A2Yl_MLUQ7kNvwGU4gB8&_nc_oc=AdqBXbHtsRt8VXzyWyLatmGekPL7lBEjNx5H-IqBDrezR-VkNJ8e8cRIyuss6mQSwn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWoyete1jtUpMaaVvBJFjAzWGe6M1x76RCdTZZ_TSnphw&oe=6B104427"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "keywords": ["horror", "adventure"], "long_description": "A game where exploration, hiding, and problem-solving take center stage, not violence and blood.\n\nCollect items while being chased by something unknown.\n\nYou'll explore a dark and threatening cabin with outdoor areas, and an unwelcome guest could be lurking around any corner. Forgotten Possessions is a gripping horror adventure from start to finish, leaving you breathless.\n\n# Features\n\n- Collect items for a mysterious person in exchange for handy equipment\n- Detailed and atmospheric environment\n- A truly eerie creature\n- An exciting blend of horror and adventure\n- There are many dark secrets to uncover.\n\n# Why Early Access?\nAs a solo indie developer, I want to collect feedback from real players in a controlled feedback loop as early as possible so that the game becomes successful! At the same time, I want to provide interested players with the fun at a reduced price as quickly as possible.\n\n**Your benefits:**\n\n1. Reduced price compared to the full release price\n2. Contribute your ideas, suggestions, and feedback using the integrated meta-tools\n3. Have fun with the latest game updates exclusively for Early Access players\n4. Be part of a growing community.\n", "short_description": "A nerve-wrecking horror adventure game where exploration, hiding, and problem-solving take center stage, not violence and blood."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.glo